{
  "text": "It's gluten-free day today, so I'm sharing a full day of eating completely gluten-free while I explain how this diet transformed my life. I was diagnosed with hypothyroidism at 10 years old, but unfortunately didn't realize it was Hashimoto's until 15 years later. And despite being on medication for 15 years, my condition worsened. I was always tired and flamed and overweight despite following a healthy diet. As a dietitian, I knew food had to be playing a role in my thyroid function, and after a ton of research, I went completely gluten-free. And the results were immediate. My TSH dropped from 18 to 2 in 6 weeks, my antibody dropped from over 1000 to just 2, and I dropped 15 pounds in 2 months. Lutin can have a negative impact on the GI tract, even in those without celiac disease. And the symptoms of sensitivity are more subtle, like waking, inflammation, mood swings, autoimmunity, so if this sounds like you, it might be time to go gluten-free. But if this sounds overwhelming, I get it. That's why I've created gluten-free plans using evidence-based strategies to decrease inflammation, support your metabolism, and get right to seeing results. Owen Gloomfree has been life-changing for me and it could be for you too. [Music]",
